{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My Little Spider is a digital companion for those long days at work, intense study sessions, or chill evenings.\u00a0 Watch your new companion collect bugs as you do other things, and pitch in here and there when you have a minute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060610/extras/69242efa217e746c3ec46fa334cc1529.poster.avif?t=1760283317\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060610/extras/69242efa217e746c3ec46fa334cc1529.webm?t=1760283317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete the Bugopedia!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 cute bugs to discover and collect   in your web.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bugs only come out at certain times of day, so pay attention to the in-game clock!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060610/extras/dbea403a9ed91b4e8bb348fe561ad423.poster.avif?t=1760283317\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060610/extras/dbea403a9ed91b4e8bb348fe561ad423.webm?t=1760283317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Travel to different Biomes!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 5 unique locations to unlock.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different bugs can spawn at different locations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spend bug coins at the shop!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your spider with different hats, skins and webs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your spider and their web.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete quests!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of quest types will have you looking for all types and sizes of bug.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily quests reset each day, and offer a shared challenge with other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover every bug from the common Blue Bottle Fly to the beautiful\u00a0Monarch Butterfly!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo version is restricted to 12 bugs, and two locations.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Upgrade","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4060610/2fc8a5956b81ff416c98dc0fd384ccc670b3d9cb.jpg"},{"name":"New Hat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4060610/2defb9fbeb7e5889b1b22872dd6380659fea36f3.jpg"},{"name":"New Spider","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4060610/81b13bb851a2e7b843ee96bdd25287cf44520088.jpg"},{"name":"Quester","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4060610/5d4adedd3d281ff92bd1c854a7e87f5aca2eba20.jpg"},{"name":"Daily Bug Munch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4060610/60b15d0d7e26a7e6e289d7052109e45375bccaf2.jpg"},{"name":"Pioneer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4060610/30f611ba989836f4689c34c8baecf8418f744a42.jpg"},{"name":"Wishlist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4060610/147fc79af15052612bc2afe5aca6b293fd6f66ce.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.